@startuml
title PetLink 系统架构图

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "PC管理端\nADMIN / RESCUER" as PCUser
actor "移动用户端\nVISITOR / USER / RESCUER" as MobileUser

rectangle "客户端层" {
  component "Vue 3 PC 管理端\nElement Plus / Vite" as Web
  component "UniApp 移动端\nVue 3" as Mobile
}

rectangle "Spring Boot 后端" {

  component "Spring Security\nJWT Filter / RBAC\n公开接口 permitAll" as Security

  component "REST Controller\n统一 API 入口" as Controller

  component "统一异常处理\nGlobal Exception Handler" as ExceptionHandler

  component "Service 业务层\n业务规则 / 权限校验" as Service

  component "事务管理\nSpring Transaction" as Tx

  component "文件服务\n上传 / 绑定 / 文件补偿" as FileService

  component "定时文件清理任务\nTemporary / Orphan Cleanup" as Cleanup

  component "持久层 Mapper\nMyBatis-Plus" as MP
}

database "MySQL 8.0\nPetLink Database" as DB

folder "服务器本地文件系统" as FS {
  folder "temporary/\n临时上传目录" as Temp
  folder "uploads/\n正式文件目录" as Uploads
}

PCUser --> Web
MobileUser --> Mobile

Web --> Security : HTTPS / REST API
Mobile --> Security : HTTPS / REST API

Security --> Controller : 鉴权 / permitAll 放行
Controller --> Service
Controller ..> ExceptionHandler : 异常映射

Tx ..> Service : @Transactional / AOP

Service --> MP
FileService --> MP
MP --> DB

Service --> FileService : 图片业务
FileService --> Temp : 临时文件
FileService --> Uploads : 正式文件

Cleanup --> FileService : 文件清理逻辑
Cleanup --> MP : 查询 temporary_file\n及业务引用

note right of Security
公开浏览、登录、注册等接口：
permitAll

受保护接口：
JWT + RBAC 后端鉴权
end note

note right of Tx
关键跨表业务使用事务：
- 救助任务接取
- 救助成功并建档
- 领养批准
- 关键状态变化 + OperationLog
end note

note right of FileService
统一负责：
- JPG/JPEG/PNG 校验
- 单张 ≤ 5MB
- UUID 文件名
- temporary_file 绑定
- copy → commit → cleanup
end note

@enduml
